{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2018-12", "window": 3, "start_date": 1544918400, "end_date": 1545609599, "month_true_total": 78, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:15:34 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "47760565", "author": {"steamid": "76561198013426194", "personaname": "BMO Chop", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198013426194/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 5, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5, "last_played": 1545603439, "avatar": "ed6275bcbd2159931ffa661bdf949b8f931dc7ec"}, "language": "english", "review": "Literlly won't run in fullscreen and doesn't support 4k resolution.  Apparently this is a common issue that was never fixed.  Even in windowed mode, can't play online with my friends.  Pure laziness on the devs part.", "timestamp_created": 1545603611, "timestamp_updated": 1545603611, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.493190765380859375", "comment_count": 4, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "47752564", "author": {"steamid": "76561198097449210", "personaname": "Quint Danger", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198097449210/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 6958, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6219, "last_played": 1621450895, "avatar": "79a30f1907c26d3228bac2cc1497f9ba51e2011b"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is one of my favorite little indie roguelikes. All of the characters have similar enough abilities that you'll understand how to play them regardless of your skill with their unique, individual mechanics which provide an incredible amount of depth and variety. You have to unlock new characters of course, but that isn't to say that who you start off with isn't fun to play, in fact the Commando is one of my favorites on the roster. Metroidvania aspects ensure strong replayabiity (good luck getting that last monster log), and there is a lot of satisfaction to be had trying to clear the game as fast as possible (which you'll be doing  a lot of for that monster log). You have a lot of options at your disposal to ensure that you can always have a relatively new experience each time you play. The world is immersive; flavor texts and item descriptions do a great job of drawing the player into the alien landscapes. The soundtrack is excellent. Really everyting about this game is just begging you to play it more, and that's a very easy request to indulge. I wrote this review because Risk of Rain 2 is well in the works and looking very promising, and you should absolutely give this game a go before it comes out.", "timestamp_created": 1545585323, "timestamp_updated": 1545585323, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "47724317", "author": {"steamid": "76561198172640226", "personaname": "owl", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198172640226/", "num_games_owned": 376, "num_reviews": 71, "playtime_forever": 1424, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1227, "last_played": 1545900667, "avatar": "d78dcd98b993e1faf7a1b7cadeed6cf20ee61a0d"}, "language": "english", "review": "♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ amazing. buy it now or i will ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ stab you.", "timestamp_created": 1545524781, "timestamp_updated": 1545524781, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_